            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Geraldine Tyler owed $15,000 in taxes and penalties; Hennepin County seized her home, sold it for $40,000, and retained the $25,000 surplus."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Geraldine Tyler",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8420ac57fa4bfecbdf590ce6ac319787446a50b402fed94fba95c6c7af7547f5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-8420ac57fa4b-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Geraldine Tyler, the legal question is whether the county\u2019s retention of the surplus constitutes a taking under the Fifth Amendment and an excessive fine under the Eighth Amendment."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background & Legal Question",
    "status": "complete",
