            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 15,
              "start": 15
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court rejected the plaintiff\u2019s belated argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8420ac57fa4bfecbdf590ce6ac319787446a50b402fed94fba95c6c7af7547f5",
