              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether a taking exists if there is no surplus equity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned whether taking and selling a home to satisfy a debt, while keeping the surplus, violates the Takings Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the county must sell the property at a regular auction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito inquired whether the theory applies to personal property such as vehicles."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked about a hypothetical state that keeps 50\u202f% of surplus as a penalty."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Barrett asked about Virginia\u2019s historical lack of a just\u2011compensation requirement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether the Nelson decision is inconsistent with Knick."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Jackson asked whether taking occurs when the government takes absolute title without a mechanism to recover excess value."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the government may keep its administrative expenses incurred during the seizure process."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether a property could be deemed abandoned, allowing the government to keep its full value."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch raised the excessive\u2011fines question, noting the district court\u2019s reasoning."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0005-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 108,
              "start": 108
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked why the state\u2019s interests are not fully accommodated when it can impose a meaningful penalty."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0005-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 109,
              "start": 109
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Jackson asked whether the county could pursue the remaining value after the property is sold to satisfy the tax debt."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "036f9c3d45eac34887942a8b0c91eb05e1468f42c22970b414be02ab838a6463",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-036f9c3d45ea-0005-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 111,
              "start": 111
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Jackson, justice Jackson questioned why the government could extinguish the owner\u2019s entire right in the property."
      }
